        "TileImage": "$($repository 6c09bd70-6670-486b-9222-15db93222b56).Image",
        "Description": "Ollie: Mr Dexter is your next target. he&apos;s staying at GAMA for lung complications. This makes him vulnerable, being out in the open and all. Kill him, Mrs Yasuda and Mr Ito, the organ trafficing doctors who got Dexter his new lungs, and Mr Carey, Dexter&apos;s close associate. Two left after this. And I still wonder if you&apos;re still guilt free... Maybe you&apos;re a sociopath who doesn&apos;t care. Or maybe it&apos;s eating away at you. Either way, it all ends when we kill the leader of the Erasers",
